  "description": "IWE 0.28.0 markdown knowledge-graph tooling for agent memory: the iwe CLI and its query language, the iwes LSP server, the iwec MCP server, the version-4 .iwe/config.toml contract and the hidden iwe internal claude commands behind the IWE Claude Code plugin's hooks and memory skills. Use when reading or writing this repository's IWE workspace or memory, editing .iwe/config.toml or .iwe/schemas, wiring iwes or iwec into an editor or MCP client, or debugging the plugin's SessionStart and PostToolUse hooks and session records. Not for IWE versions other than 0.28.0, and not for changing the iwe-org/skills plugin itself.",
